ash third-party license inventory
=================================

This file records the third-party Rust packages resolved by Cargo.lock for the
0.1.0 source baseline. Package authors retain all rights to their work. The
license expression following each package is the SPDX expression published in
that package's Cargo metadata.

Stable release packaging MUST regenerate this inventory from Cargo.lock and
append the complete applicable license and notice texts harvested from the
packaged crate sources. A release is blocked if any dependency has no accepted
license expression or its required text cannot be collected.

